Part | Content
Zero | The ABC: 30 key terms; the forms of violence across a woman's life-cycle
Ch. 1 | Defining gender-based violence — the international definitions and their elements
Ch. 2 | Forms and sites of violence in Pakistan (2016, 2017, 2023)
Ch. 3 | Theories of violence against women — feminist, social learning, psychological, family systems, resource, ecological; power and control (2020)
